## Sunshine on a Ranney Day — HTTP Security Headers
## These headers improve security, Lighthouse scores, and SEO trust signals.
##
## Each page route has two Content-Security-Policy lines:
##   Content-Security-Policy              enforced; still allows any inline script
##   Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only  the strict one: inline scripts only by
##     sha256 hash, no inline on*= handlers (script-src-attr 'none'). Browsers
##     report what it would block to /api/csp-report (functions/api/csp-report.js).
## 'csp-hashes' is a placeholder: scripts/csp-hash.mjs (run by `npm run build`)
## swaps in the hash of every inline script in the build when it writes
## dist/_headers, and fails the build on an inline handler, a javascript: URL or
## a line over Cloudflare's 2,000 characters. Its ENFORCE switch makes the
## strict line the enforced one. Keep each Report-Only line the same as the
## line above it apart from script-src and the report directives (the build
## checks that too).

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(self "https://www.zeffy.com")
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies: none
  Origin-Agent-Cluster: ?1
  Reporting-Endpoints: csp="/api/csp-report"
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https://imagedelivery.net https://i.ytimg.com https://videodelivery.net https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com data: blob:; font-src 'self'; frame-src 'self' https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://iframe.videodelivery.net https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com https://www.zeffy.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; connect-src 'self' wss://sunshineonaranneyday.com https://imagedelivery.net https://cloudflareinsights.com https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com; media-src 'self' blob: https://videodelivery.net https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com https://files.sunshineonaranneyday.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'csp-hashes' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; script-src-attr 'none'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https://imagedelivery.net https://i.ytimg.com https://videodelivery.net https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com data: blob:; font-src 'self'; frame-src 'self' https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://iframe.videodelivery.net https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com https://www.zeffy.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; connect-src 'self' wss://sunshineonaranneyday.com https://imagedelivery.net https://cloudflareinsights.com https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com; media-src 'self' blob: https://videodelivery.net https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com https://files.sunshineonaranneyday.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; report-uri /api/csp-report; report-to csp

