## Admin panel — its own CSP (behind Cloudflare Access auth).
## `! Content-Security-Policy` (and `! Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only`)
## detach the /* CSP above so this policy fully replaces it — admin-only hosts
## (map tiles, JobTread, Stream uploads) live ONLY here, keeping the public
## policy tight. Third-party JS is bundled locally in /admin/vendor.js, so no
## CDN (esm.sh) appears in script-src/connect-src. frame-src 'self' lets
## Preview frame the site's own pages. cdn.jobtread.com in connect-src lets the
## file viewer (/admin/file-viewer.js) read a family's PDFs and save files under
## their own name. cdn.plaid.com (script and frame) and Plaid's API (connect)
## are Plaid's window for Board → Settings → Bank balances (public/admin/board-banks.js),
## loaded from Plaid only when someone connects a bank. Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy
## keeps other sites from loading admin files.
/admin/*
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://cdn.plaid.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' https://imagedelivery.net https://videodelivery.net https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com https://i.ytimg.com https://tile.openstreetmap.org https://cdn.jobtread.com https://avatars.githubusercontent.com data: blob:; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' wss://sunshineonaranneyday.com https://imagedelivery.net https://cloudflareinsights.com https://upload.videodelivery.net https://upload.cloudflarestream.com https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com https://cdn.jobtread.com https://production.plaid.com https://sandbox.plaid.com; frame-src 'self' https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com https://iframe.videodelivery.net https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://www.facebook.com https://cdn.plaid.com; media-src 'self' blob: https://customer-cuav5h47lgfe96ql.cloudflarestream.com https://cdn.jobtread.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; manifest-src 'self'
